    "description": "You can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> to vanish from the sight of a single target within line of sight. If the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check exceeds the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>, you gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Total_Concealment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Concealment\">Total Concealment</a> from that target until the beginning of your next turn, or until you make an attack roll or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> against the target.",
